例如紫外线、可见光、红外线、微波和无线电波，可以看到它们的波长很长。

29
00:14:09,420 --> 00:14:29,740
So in this slide we'll talk about the types of radiation.
这张幻灯片我们讲辐射的类型。

30
00:14:29,740 --> 00:14:33,740
So we have the radiation is classified into two main categories.
辐射分为两大类。

31
00:14:33,740 --> 00:14:38,740
We have the non-ionizing radiation which cannot ionize matter.
一类是不能使物质电离的非电离辐射，

32
00:14:38,740 --> 00:14:42,740
And we have the ionizing radiation which can ionize matter.
另一类是能使物质电离的电离辐射。

33
00:14:42,740 --> 00:14:49,040
The ionizing radiation is classified into two types.
电离辐射又分为两种。

34
00:14:49,040 --> 00:14:53,040
Directly ionizing radiation which is the charged particles.
直接电离辐射，也就是带电粒子，

35
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:58,040
Examples electron, proton, alpha particles and heavy ion.
例如电子、质子、阿尔法粒子和重离子。

36
00:14:58,040 --> 00:15:07,040
Whereas the indirectly ionizing radiation we have the neutral particles like photons, x-ray, gamma ray and the neutron.
而间接电离辐射是中性粒子，比如光子、X 射线、伽马射线和中子。

37
00:15:07,040 --> 00:15:32,730
This is the international sample of ionizing radiation and I guess everyone of us is aware of this.
这是电离辐射的国际标志，我想大家都知道这个。

38
00:15:32,730 --> 00:15:36,730
