00:45:48,210 --> 00:45:55,210
So if this is the radiation, if we are away a distance x, so we have the dose here equal to one,
假设这是辐射，如果我们离开距离 x，这里的剂量等于 1，

250
00:45:55,210 --> 00:46:00,210
if we are double the distance, we have the dose one over four,
如果距离加倍，剂量就是四分之一，

251
00:46:00,210 --> 00:46:05,210
if we are three times distance, so the dose is one over nine.
如果距离是三倍，剂量就是九分之一。

252
00:46:05,210 --> 00:46:11,020
This is analogous to standing near a fire.
这就类似于站在火堆旁边。

