我想大家都听说过，它是说，辐射从源向外传播时，

261
00:46:52,270 --> 00:46:56,270
the intensity decreases inversely with the square of the distance.
强度与距离的平方成反比地减小。

262
00:46:56,270 --> 00:46:57,270
And this is the equation.
这就是公式。

263
00:46:57,270 --> 00:47:01,270
So the inverse square law, sorry, there is some samples not coming correctly.
平方反比定律，抱歉，有些符号显示得不正确。

264
00:47:01,270 --> 00:47:02,270
This is multiplication.
这是乘号。

265
00:47:02,270 --> 00:47:08,270
So I1 multiplied by x1 squared equal I2 multiplied by x2 squared.
I1 乘以 x1 的平方等于 I2 乘以 x2 的平方。

266
00:47:08,270 --> 00:47:12,270
Whereas I is the intensity and x is the distance.
其中 I 是强度，x 是距离。

