Some slices will move on fastly.
有些幻灯片会讲得快一点。

408
00:58:51,800 --> 00:58:55,140
Thank you, Muhammad.
谢谢你，Muhammad。

409
00:58:55,140 --> 00:58:58,140
So the activity is the donation is dn by dt.
活度的表示式是 dN/dt。

410
00:58:58,140 --> 00:59:01,140
dn is the number of photons you have, and dt is the time.
dN 是光子的数目，dt 是时间。

411
00:59:01,140 --> 00:59:07,060
And the SI unit of the activity is bikrel.
活度的国际单位是贝可勒尔。

412
00:59:07,060 --> 00:59:13,370
And 1 bikrel is equal to 1 disintegration per second.
1 贝可勒尔等于每秒 1 次衰变。

413
00:59:13,370 --> 00:59:16,370
The older classical unit is the Curie,
旧的传统单位是居里，

414
00:59:16,370 --> 00:59:19,370
stated for Maria Curie.
以玛丽·居里命名。

415
00:59:19,370 --> 00:59:24,370
And 1 Curie is the activity of 0.980 gram of radium equilibrium
1 居里是与其子体处于平衡状态的 0.980 克镭的

416
00:59:24,370 --> 00:59:26,370
with its daughters.
活度。

417
00:59:26,370 --> 00:59:32,480
And 1 Curie is equal to 3.7 10 to the power 9 bikrel,
1 居里等于 3.7 乘以 10 的 9 次方贝可勒尔，

418
00:59:32,480 --> 00:59:37,480
and it's equal to 3.7 10 to the power 10 disintegration per second.
也等于每秒 3.7 乘以 10 的 10 次方次衰变。

419
00:59:37,480 --> 00:59:40,480
This square, I'm sorry, it's multiplication,
这个方框，抱歉，它是乘号，

420
00:59:40,480 --> 00:59:48,610
but I don't know why it's not coming properly in the presentation.
但我不知道为什么在演示文稿里显示不正常。

421
00:59:48,610 --> 00:59:52,610
Okay, what is the activity in both bikrel and Curie for a source emits?
好，一个源在 3 分钟内发出

422
00:59:52,610 --> 00:59:56,610
7.4 10 to the power 9 photons in 3 minutes.
7.4 乘以 10 的 9 次方个光子，它的活度用贝可勒尔和居里分别是多少？

423
00:59:56,610 --> 00:59:58,610
Let's have another roll.
我们再投一次票。

424
00:59:58,610 --> 01:00:06,260
5.
5 个。

425
01:00:06,260 --> 01:00:14,020
Let's do it.
我们来做吧。

426
01:00:14,020 --> 01:00:38,950
Come on, guys.
加油，各位。

427
01:00:38,950 --> 01:00:39,950
Straightforward.
很直接。

428
01:00:39,950 --> 01:01:10,960
5 volts only out of 20.
20 个人里只有 5 个投了票。

429
01:01:10,960 --> 01:01:42,600
Just give me the activity in Curie.
只要给出居里单位的活度就行。

430
01:01:42,600 --> 01:01:43,600
It's not a problem with in bikrel.
贝可勒尔的没关系，

431
01:01:43,600 --> 01:01:45,600
Just get it in Curie.
只要算出居里就行。

432
01:01:45,600 --> 01:01:53,030
Two more to go.
还差两个。

433
01:01:53,030 --> 01:01:55,030
We are 8.
我们有 8 个了。

434
01:01:55,030 --> 01:02:05,410
9.
9 个。

435
01:02:05,410 --> 01:02:08,840
Okay.
好。

436
01:02:08,840 --> 01:02:15,490
I don't want to tell who answered correctly and who did not.
我不想说谁答对了谁没答对。

437
01:02:15,490 --> 01:02:18,490
Anyhow, let's solve it.
总之，我们来解题。

438
01:02:19,490 --> 01:02:23,930
So a equal dn by dt,
A 等于 dN/dt，

439
01:02:23,930 --> 01:02:28,930
and equal 7.4 10 to the power 9 photons,
等于 7.4 乘以 10 的 9 次方个光子，

440
01:02:28,930 --> 01:02:31,930
divided by 3 minutes multiplied by 60 seconds.
除以 3 分钟乘以 60 秒。

441
01:02:31,930 --> 01:02:36,400
This equal to 41.1 megabikrel,
结果等于 41.1 兆贝可勒尔，

442
01:02:36,400 --> 01:02:39,400
and now we convert it into Curie.
现在我们把它换算成居里。

443
01:02:39,400 --> 01:02:41,400
So 41 10 to the power 6 bikrel,
41 乘以 10 的 6 次方贝可勒尔，

444
01:02:41,400 --> 01:02:44,400
divided by 3.7 10 to the power 9 bikrel per Curie,
除以每居里 3.7 乘以 10 的 9 次方贝可勒尔，

445
01:02:44,400 --> 01:02:48,400
and this equal to 1.11 millikrel.
结果等于 1.11 毫居里。

446
01:02:48,400 --> 01:02:52,400
So we have, how many ones answered?
有多少人答了？

447
01:02:52,400 --> 01:02:56,400
So we have like 37% of the people answered correctly,
大约 37% 的人答对了，

448
01:02:56,400 --> 01:02:58,400
out of the rest.
其余的人里。

449
01:02:58,400 --> 01:03:00,400
30%, not bad.
30%，还不错。

450
01:03:00,400 --> 01:03:01,400
Okay.
好。

451
01:03:01,400 --> 01:03:09,900
We have life, t half,
半衰期，T½，

452
01:03:09,900 --> 01:03:14,900
time required for substance to lose half of radioactivity.
是物质失去一半放射性所需的时间。

453
01:03:14,900 --> 01:03:18,900
Every radio nuclei has a unique half-life,
每种放射性核素都有独特的半衰期，

454
01:03:18,900 --> 01:03:22,900
ranging from less than one second
从不到一秒

455
01:03:22,900 --> 01:03:25,900
to billions of years.
到数十亿年不等。

456
01:03:25,900 --> 01:03:27,900
The general formula for activity,
活度的通用公式是

457
01:03:27,900 --> 01:03:30,900
a equal a zero e to the minus lambda t,
A 等于 A0 乘以 e 的负 λt 次方，

458
01:03:30,900 --> 01:03:32,900
where a is the activity after time t,
其中 A 是经过时间 t 后的活度，

459
01:03:32,900 --> 01:03:34,900
and a zero is the initial activity,
A0 是初始活度，

460
01:03:34,900 --> 01:03:36,900
or at t equals zero.
也就是 t 等于零时的活度。

461
01:03:36,900 --> 01:03:38,900
Lambda is the decay constant,
λ 是衰变常数，

462
01:03:38,900 --> 01:03:40,900
and it's the unit of t minus one,
单位是 t 的负一次方，

463
01:03:40,900 --> 01:03:43,900
I mean time minus one, like second minus one,
我是说时间的负一次方，比如秒的负一次方、

464
01:03:43,900 --> 01:03:45,900
year minus one, wherever,
年的负一次方，都可以，

465
01:03:45,900 --> 01:03:47,900
and t is the decay time.
t 是衰变时间。

466
01:03:47,900 --> 01:03:49,900
And we have the half-life,
还有半衰期，

467
01:03:49,900 --> 01:03:53,900
t half equal Lin 2 divided by lambda.
T½ 等于 ln2 除以 λ。

468
01:03:53,900 --> 01:03:55,900
Lin 2 is 0.693.
ln2 是 0.693。

469
01:03:55,900 --> 01:04:00,550
Okay.
好。

470
01:04:00,550 --> 01:04:02,550
Let's have this question.
我们来看这道题。

471
01:04:02,550 --> 01:04:04,550
This is number 6.
这是第 6 题。

472
01:04:04,550 --> 01:04:13,500
A container has initial activity
一个容器中

473
01:04:13,500 --> 01:04:15,500
of barium, 137 meter stable state,
钡-137 亚稳态的初始活度

474
01:04:15,500 --> 01:04:17,500
equal to 100 millikrel.
等于 100 毫居里。

475
01:04:17,500 --> 01:04:19,500
If the half-life of barium,
如果钡-137 亚稳态的

476
01:04:19,500 --> 01:04:22,500
137 meter stable state is 2.55 minutes,
半衰期是 2.55 分钟，

477
01:04:22,500 --> 01:04:26,500
what will be the final activity after 15 minutes?
15 分钟后的最终活度是多少？

478
01:05:14,990 --> 01:05:15,990
Okay.
好。

479
01:05:15,990 --> 01:05:41,360
We are getting people answering fast and right.
有人答得又快又对。

480
01:05:41,360 --> 01:05:44,360
I increase the time a little bit
我把时间稍微加长一点，

481
01:05:44,360 --> 01:05:46,360
for like 30 minutes more,
再加大约 30 分钟，

482
01:05:46,360 --> 01:05:49,360
because I guess we are doing very slow.
因为我觉得我们进度很慢。

483
01:05:49,360 --> 01:05:52,360
Anyhow, we are 10.
总之，我们有 10 个人了。

484
01:05:52,360 --> 01:05:57,620
We could answer that question.
这道题我们能答出来。

485
01:05:57,620 --> 01:05:58,620
Okay.
好。

486
01:05:58,620 --> 01:06:01,640
So the solution.
解答。

487
01:06:01,640 --> 01:06:04,640
Half-life, t half equal Lin 2 over lambda,
半衰期 T½ 等于 ln2 除以 λ，

488
01:06:04,640 --> 01:06:06,640
and lambda equal Lin 2 over t half,
λ 等于 ln2 除以 T½，

489
01:06:06,640 --> 01:06:09,640
which is equal to 0.693 over 2.55 minutes.
也就是 0.693 除以 2.55 分钟。

490
01:06:09,640 --> 01:06:13,640
This is equal to 0.272 minute minus 1.
结果等于 0.272 每分钟。

491
01:06:13,640 --> 01:06:15,640
Then, substituting the equation,
然后代入公式，

492
01:06:15,640 --> 01:06:17,640
E equal E0 to the minus lambda t,
A 等于 A0 乘以 e 的负 λt 次方，

493
01:06:17,640 --> 01:06:21,640
100 millicry, E to the minus 0.27.
100 毫居里乘以 e 的负 0.27 次方。

494
01:06:21,640 --> 01:06:24,640
This is equal 1.69 millicry.
结果等于 1.69 毫居里。

495
01:06:24,640 --> 01:06:27,640
I see the guys who answered after I showed the answer.
我看到有些同学是在我公布答案之后才作答的。

496
01:06:27,640 --> 01:06:28,640
Okay.
好。

497
01:06:28,640 --> 01:06:29,640
No problem.
没关系。

498
01:06:29,640 --> 01:06:31,640
At least we are solving it.
至少我们在解题。

499
01:06:31,640 --> 01:06:36,860
Okay.
好。

500
01:06:36,860 --> 01:06:37,860
Let's go on.
我们继续。

501
01:06:37,860 --> 01:06:46,670
Exposure.
照射量。

502
01:06:46,670 --> 01:06:48,670
And this is William Renjin.
这位是威廉·伦琴。

503
01:06:48,670 --> 01:06:50,670
I think everybody knows who is William Renjin.
我想大家都知道威廉·伦琴是谁。

504
01:06:50,670 --> 01:06:54,670
The quantity exposure describes an X-ray or gamma-ray field.
照射量这个量描述的是 X 射线或伽马射线场。

505
01:06:54,670 --> 01:06:57,670
It is a measure of the amount of ionization
它是 X 射线或伽马射线在空气中

506
01:06:57,670 --> 01:07:01,670
produced in an air by the X-ray or gamma-ray.
产生的电离量的量度。

507
01:07:01,670 --> 01:07:06,670
Exposure is defined as amount of charge of either signs,
照射量定义为 X 射线或伽马射线在一千克空气中产生的

508
01:07:06,670 --> 01:07:08,670
I mean positive or negative,
任一符号，也就是正或负

509
01:07:08,670 --> 01:07:13,670
produced by X-ray or gamma-ray in one kilogram of air.
电荷的电量，

510
01:07:13,670 --> 01:07:16,670
When all charges, positive and negative,
条件是所有的正负电荷

511
01:07:16,670 --> 01:07:18,670
are stopped in the air.
都在空气中被阻止。

512
01:07:18,670 --> 01:07:21,460
It comes in the sample.
它用这个符号表示：

513
01:07:21,460 --> 01:07:24,460
X equal dQ by dm.
X 等于 dQ/dm。

514
01:07:24,460 --> 01:07:27,460
The SI unit is column bare kilogram.
国际单位是库仑每千克。

515
01:07:27,460 --> 01:07:31,460
And all the classical units, all of us know it's the Renjin.
传统单位，大家都知道，是伦琴。

516
01:07:31,460 --> 01:07:39,460
And one Renjin equal 2.58 10 to the power minus 4 column bare kilogram.
1 伦琴等于 2.58 乘以 10 的负 4 次方库仑每千克。

517
01:07:39,460 --> 01:07:43,460
We have three main limitations for the exposure.
照射量有三个主要的局限。

518
01:07:43,460 --> 01:07:47,460
The first thing, applicable only for X-rays or gamma-rays.
第一，只适用于 X 射线或伽马射线。

519
01:07:47,460 --> 01:07:48,460
Only.
仅限于此。

520
01:07:48,460 --> 01:07:52,710
So it doesn't apply for charged particles.
所以它不适用于带电粒子。

521
01:07:52,710 --> 01:07:56,710
Next, applicable only for air.
第二，只适用于空气。

522
01:07:56,710 --> 01:07:57,710
No other material.
不适用于其他物质。

523
01:07:57,710 --> 01:08:00,710
So we cannot say we have exposure inside the body.
所以我们不能说身体内部有照射量，

524
01:08:00,710 --> 01:08:02,710
We cannot say we have exposure inside that material.
也不能说某种材料内部有照射量。

525
01:08:02,710 --> 01:08:04,710
It's only in air.
它只适用于空气。

526
01:08:04,710 --> 01:08:11,660
And third one, cannot be measured for high photon beams.
第三，对于高能光子束无法测量。

527
01:08:11,660 --> 01:08:13,660
Okay, this is very important.
好，这一点非常重要。

528
01:08:13,660 --> 01:08:20,530
Limitations for the exposure.
照射量的局限性。

529
01:08:20,530 --> 01:08:26,840
Okay, there is very nice formula to calculate the exposure.
好，有一个非常好的公式可以计算照射量。

530
01:08:26,840 --> 01:08:31,840
So the exposure, X equal 10 milliRenjin multiplied by MAS.
照射量 X 等于 10 毫伦琴乘以 mAs，

531
01:08:31,840 --> 01:08:34,840
We know the MAS, all of us, I think.
mAs 我想大家都知道，

532
01:08:34,840 --> 01:08:37,840
Divided by R squared, this is distance.
除以 R 的平方，这是距离，

533
01:08:37,840 --> 01:08:41,840
Multiplied by kVb over 100 squared.
再乘以 kVp 除以 100 的平方。

534
01:08:41,840 --> 01:08:46,840
So by this equation, if you have MAS for the machine and the kVb,
通过这个公式，如果你知道机器的 mAs 和 kVp，

535
01:08:46,840 --> 01:08:55,600
you can directly estimate what is the exposure at that location.
就可以直接估算出那个位置的照射量。

536
01:08:55,600 --> 01:09:01,600
The exposure, X, is linear proportional with the tube voltage, kVb to the power 2.07.
照射量 X 与管电压 kVp 的 2.07 次方成正比。

537
01:09:01,600 --> 01:09:04,600
We approximated to 2.
我们近似为 2。

538
01:09:04,600 --> 01:09:08,600
When kVb increases, the exposure also increases to the power of 2.
当 kVp 增大时，照射量也按 2 次方增大。

539
01:09:08,600 --> 01:09:11,600
And we see this in the equation.
我们在公式里可以看到这一点。

540
01:09:11,600 --> 01:09:13,600
So the kVb increases by 2.
所以 kVp 增加到 2 倍，

541
01:09:13,600 --> 01:09:19,600
Then all the exposure is increased by 2.
照射量就会按 2 次方增加。

542
01:09:19,600 --> 01:09:22,600
The exposure is linear proportional with MA and MAS.
照射量与 mA 和 mAs 成线性正比，

543
01:09:22,600 --> 01:09:24,600
Milliambere and milliambere second.
也就是毫安和毫安秒。

544
01:09:24,600 --> 01:09:27,600
If MAS is constant, the exposure is constant.
如果 mAs 不变，照射量就不变，

545
01:09:27,600 --> 01:09:32,600
Whether MA or the time is or are changed.
无论 mA 或时间是否改变。

546
01:09:32,600 --> 01:09:42,030
The exposure, X, is linear proportional with the inverse square value of the distance from the X-ray source.
照射量 X 与离 X 射线源距离的平方成反比。

547
01:09:42,030 --> 01:09:46,030
As we seen in the previous slides, the inverse square law also applies here.
正如我们在前面的幻灯片里看到的，平方反比定律在这里也适用。

548
01:09:46,030 --> 01:09:50,030
The farther the distance, the lower the exposure you receive.
距离越远，你受到的照射量越低。

549
01:09:50,030 --> 01:09:55,980
Let's have another question, or two more questions.
我们再来一道题，或者再来两道题。

550
01:09:55,980 --> 01:10:05,310
This is number seven.
这是第七题。

551
01:10:05,310 --> 01:10:09,310
Okay, calculate the exposure for the following machine parameters.
好，根据下列机器参数计算照射量：

552
01:10:09,310 --> 01:10:14,310
kVb 80, MAS 3, R50CM.
kVp 80，mAs 3，R 为 50 厘米。

553
01:10:14,310 --> 01:10:24,020
If you would like, I can show back the equation, so it will be easy for you to answer.
如果需要，我可以把公式再显示出来，这样你们回答起来会容易些。

554
01:10:24,020 --> 01:11:22,820
One correct, one wrong, 2 votes, 4 votes, 6 votes, 8.
一个对，一个错，2 票，4 票，6 票，8 票。

555
01:11:22,820 --> 01:11:27,820
We need more, maybe another one, and we could stop, 9.
还需要更多，也许再来一个就可以停了，9 票。

556
01:11:27,820 --> 01:11:29,820
That's it.
好了。

557
01:11:29,820 --> 01:11:34,810
Okay, so let's solve it.
好，我们来解题。

558
01:11:34,810 --> 01:11:42,340
So we got, more or less, 40% of you answered correctly.
大约 40% 的人答对了。

559
01:11:42,340 --> 01:11:49,340
So we come to this equation, exposure equal 10MR, MAS over R squared, kVb over 100 squared.
用这个公式，照射量等于 10 mR 乘以 mAs 除以 R 的平方，再乘以 kVp 除以 100 的平方。

560
01:11:49,340 --> 01:11:53,340
And we got 76.8 milliampere.
得到 76.8 毫伦琴。

561
01:11:53,340 --> 01:11:57,340
Okay, let's have another question.
好，我们再来一题。

562
01:11:57,340 --> 01:12:10,860
This is number eight.
这是第八题。

563
01:12:10,860 --> 01:12:17,860
Calculate the exposure for the following machine parameters, kVb 120, MAS 3, and R equal 50.
根据下列机器参数计算照射量：kVp 120，mAs 3，R 等于 50。

564
01:12:17,860 --> 01:13:17,260
Seven votes, we need another two more, eight, another one.
七票，还需要两票，八票，再来一票。

565
01:13:17,260 --> 01:13:28,150
Okay, so the answer is 172.8 milliampere.
好，答案是 172.8 毫伦琴。

566
01:13:28,150 --> 01:13:36,780
And we got, more or less, 40% of the people answered correctly.
大约 40% 的人答对了。

567
01:13:36,780 --> 01:13:40,310
Let's see how we solve it.
我们来看怎么解。

568
01:13:40,310 --> 01:13:50,310
So directly 10MR multiplied by 3 over 0.5 squared multiplied by 120 over 100, this is equal 172.8 milliampere.
直接用 10 mR 乘以 3 除以 0.5 的平方，再乘以 120 除以 100，结果等于 172.8 毫伦琴。

569
01:13:50,310 --> 01:13:59,220
Okay, let's move on.
好，我们继续。

570
01:13:59,220 --> 01:14:04,220
Absorb those, any medium, any type of radiation, not as the exposure.
吸收剂量，适用于任何介质、任何类型的辐射，不像照射量。

571
01:14:04,220 --> 01:14:09,220
Exposure only in air, only in air, and only for what?
照射量只适用于空气，只适用于空气，而且只适用于什么？

572
01:14:09,220 --> 01:14:12,220
For photons and X-rays.
光子和 X 射线。

573
01:14:12,220 --> 01:14:15,950
It doesn't apply for charged particles.
