对比度是影像上相邻结构之间的密度差。

774
01:30:59,150 --> 01:31:05,150
KVB and density of the body part impacts the amount of scatter radiation.
kVp 和身体部位的密度会影响散射辐射的量。

775
01:31:05,150 --> 01:31:10,150
High KVB, more scatter, equal low contrast, more penetration.
高 kVp，散射更多，对比度低，穿透力更强。

776
01:31:10,150 --> 01:31:14,150
So you have to choose your KVB according to what you are looking for.
所以你必须根据你要观察的内容来选择 kVp。

777
01:31:14,150 --> 01:31:17,150
If you are looking for a low contrast, then you can use the KVB.
如果你要的是低对比度，就可以用这个 kVp。

778
01:31:17,150 --> 01:31:25,150
If you are looking for more penetration, as a patient is obese, you need to use higher KVB.
如果你需要更强的穿透力，比如患者比较肥胖，就需要用更高的 kVp。

779
01:31:25,150 --> 01:31:31,130
Lower KVB, less scatter, high contrast, less penetration.
低 kVp，散射更少，对比度高，穿透力更弱。

780
01:31:31,130 --> 01:31:37,600
For superficial or thin patient, you can use the lower KVB.
对于浅表部位或瘦的患者，可以用较低的 kVp。

781
01:31:37,600 --> 01:31:42,600
Optimum KVB, consistent scatter, adequate contrast, and sufficient penetration.
最佳 kVp：散射稳定，对比度足够，穿透力充分。

782
01:31:42,600 --> 01:31:47,600
