Whereas for bone, like sarcoma and so on, we reach up to 70 gray, because they are radio resistant.
而对于骨，比如肉瘤之类的，我们会达到 70 戈瑞，因为它们是抗辐射的。

969
01:46:22,240 --> 01:46:26,240
So we need more dose to kill such...
